  "description": "The all new Quest models are the ‘SUV’ of eBikes; comfortable, capable and tough. They can handle the worst that the urban environment can throw at them as well as light off road duties when needed.\nThe Quest 1.0 is our entry level durable urban commuter.\nThe Quest 1.0 is the do it all SUV bike at an unbelievably accessible price. Commuting, trails, shopping, or heading to the beach…… all of them are made effortless. The super low step through frame design is made for accessibility.\nFuss free with its integrated cables, headset, and 10.4ah battery, giving a clean look and increased reliability. The rear hub mounted Bafang 250w G020 motor produces a consistent 45nm of torque ensuring the wind is always in your sails.\nWhen riding the Quest 1.0 comfort comes as standard. High volume 2.35” tyres, 80mm front suspension by Zoom, Selle Royal comfort saddle, adjustable stem, ergonomic grips, and bar mounted digital display are all there to give you the best ride possible. Topping this all off is a set of full-length mudguards, rear mounted rack, and built-in lights.\nCould you want for anymore? We don’t think so….. The Quest 1.0 is available in 25km/h or 32km/hr speed models depending on geographic location.\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike and eScooter safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
